---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import WhyUs from '../components/WhyUs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Queer Group Trips in Tulum, Camp-Style | Queerness Experiences" description={"Bring 3 or more friends or join the waitlist. Adventure, dance, family and team camps in Tulum with cenotes, local food and a queer local guide. Starting at $4,000 per person for 4 days and 5 nights."}>

<header class="head">
  <div class="head-top">
    <div class="shape-y"></div>
    <p class="head-eye">★ Group trips · Tulum</p>
    <h1>Queer Camp-Style<br>Group Trips</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="head-cols">
  <div class="head-left">
  <p class="head-body">Summer camp, reimagined for sapphic, queer, and trans grownups, with Mexican flair. Every trip is personalized and every activity is mix and match. Bring your friends and I'll build the itinerary, or join the waitlist for our bigger camps.</p>
  <div class="head-chips">
    <span class="head-chip">Kayaking the biosphere</span>
    <span class="head-chip">Dancing</span>
    <span class="head-chip">Singing</span>
    <span class="head-chip">Painting</span>
    <span class="head-chip">Birdwatching</span>
    <span class="head-chip">Pre-Hispanic and Mexican food</span>
    <span class="head-chip">Stories with people who get it</span>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-grid">
    <img src="/images/camp-queerness-picnic.jpg" alt="Friends painting together over a spread of fresh fruit in the jungle near Tulum" style="object-position:center 15%;">
    <img src="/images/IMG_1374.jpeg" alt="Swinging out over a cenote on a Camp Queerness trip in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_3762-crop.jpeg" alt="Birdwatching with binoculars near a lagoon in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/22943efe-94cd-4c5a-b7bd-48c4afb5ba28.jpg" alt="Friends laughing together over drinks in Tulum">
  </div>
  <p class="head-credit">Created by Santi Solis, a queer, bilingual, bicultural UCLA-trained biologist. Born in Mexico, living in Tulum since 2017.</p>

  </div>
</header>

<section class="start-now">
  <div class="start-now-inner">
    <div class="start-now-text">
      <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--dark);">Now booking for winter</p>
      <h2>Groups of 3 or more<br>can plan a private<br>group trip now.</h2>
      <p>Pick your camp, pick your dates, and we'll build the itinerary around your group. Camps start at $4,000 per person for 4 days and 5 nights, with group rates available. Book 3 or more months ahead and ask about an early-booking rate. Dates for our open camps are coming soon.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="start-now-cta">
      <a href="/bring-your-group" class="btn-groups">Plan a Group Trip →</a>
      <a href="mailto:info@queernessexperiences.com?subject=Book%20a%20call%20about%20a%20camp" class="start-now-link">Or email me to book a call →</a>
      <a href="/waitlist" class="start-now-link">Or join the waitlist for open camps →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="glance" aria-label="Camp at a glance">
  <div class="glance-grid">
    <div><span class="glance-k">From</span><span class="glance-v">$4,000 per person</span></div>
    <div><span class="glance-k">Length</span><span class="glance-v">4 days, 5 nights</span></div>
    <div><span class="glance-k">Group size</span><span class="glance-v">3 to 13 people</span></div>
    <div><span class="glance-k">Stay</span><span class="glance-v">Private villa with a pool</span></div>
    <div><span class="glance-k">Includes</span><span class="glance-v">Airport pickups, most meals, all activities and classes</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<WhyUs />

<section class="reviews" id="reviews">
  <div class="reviews-inner">
  <p class="sec-eye">Our reviews</p>
  <h2>What people say</h2>
  <p class="scroll-hint">← swipe to read more →</p>
  <div class="review-scroll">
    <div class="rcard">
      <div class="rstars">★★★★★</div>
      <input type="checkbox" id="grev1" class="rev-toggle">
      <p class="rtext">Ay ay ay, what a time!!! Santi was a dream. The entire tour, start to finish, through Tulum and into the jungle and down into the cenote was better than I ever could've imagined.</p>
      <label for="grev1" class="rev-more">Read more</label>
      <p class="rname">Corinna Harris, Google review</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rcard">
      <div class="rstars">★★★★★</div>
      <input type="checkbox" id="grev2" class="rev-toggle">
      <p class="rtext">My partner and I booked two tours with Santi during our trip to Tulum, Street Food in the evening and Cenotes the next day. Before the trip, Santi was incredibly communicative and helpful as I planned, offering amazing local recs.</p>
      <label for="grev2" class="rev-more">Read more</label>
      <p class="rname">Madge Dietrich, Google review</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rcard">
      <div class="rstars">★★★★★</div>
      <input type="checkbox" id="grev3" class="rev-toggle">
      <p class="rtext">We found Santi on Reddit while looking for queer experiences in Tulum and had a great tailored tour of the Muyil river. During the tour, they use their extensive knowledge in marine biology to share facts about the river.</p>
      <label for="grev3" class="rev-more">Read more</label>
      <p class="rname">Diana Ledesma, Google review</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Queerness+Experiences/@20.4203707,-87.5893973,94594m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m8!3m7!1s0x213eac5d05676035:0x9ad4bb88e0a769c2!8m2!3d20.4200372!4d-87.259726!9m1!1b1!16s%2Fg%2F11w4tpph1c?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-reviews">Read all reviews on Google →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PICK YOUR CAMP -->
<section class="camp-types" id="camps">
  <p class="sec-eye">Step 1: Pick your camp</p>
  <h2>Queer camps tailored<br>to your group</h2>
  <p class="camp-types-lead">A private group camp is a trip built around your group: 3 to 13 people, one villa, and a queer Tulum local planning every day. The camp you pick sets the focus. Every camp includes cenotes, great local food, and time to explore Tulum, and you can mix and match activities from any of them.</p>
  <div class="camp-type-grid">
    <div class="camp-type camp-type-adventure">
      <img class="camp-type-photo" src="/images/monkey-canoe-paddle.jpg" alt="Santi smiling while paddling a canoe on a lagoon near Tulum" style="object-position:center 30%;">
      <h3>Adventure Camp</h3>
      <p class="camp-price"><strong>From $4,000 per person</strong><span>4 days, 5 nights. Longer trips available.</span></p>
      <p>More time outside, in the jungle and the biosphere reserve, on top of the cenotes and great food every camp has.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Kayak at sunset on the lagoon</li>
        <li>Row a Mayan canoe with a local team</li>
        <li>Search for birds and monkeys</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#activities" class="camp-type-link">See all possible activities ↓</a>
    </div>
    <div class="camp-type camp-type-dance">
      <video class="camp-type-photo" src="/images/dance-class-clip.mp4" poster="/images/dance-class-pose.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Dancers stepping together in a dance class near Tulum" style="object-position:center 50%;"></video>
      <h3>Dance Camp</h3>
      <p class="camp-price"><strong>From $4,000 per person</strong><span>4 days, 5 nights. Longer trips available.</span></p>
      <p>A safe place to explore your body through dance, with no gender roles. Connect with your body and your breath.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Salsa, bachata, vogue, and waacking</li>
        <li>Contemporary, folk, and African dance</li>
        <li>Lead, follow, or switch, your choice</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#activities" class="camp-type-link">See all possible activities ↓</a>
    </div>
    <div class="camp-type camp-type-family">
      <img class="camp-type-photo" src="/images/tours-gallery-picnic.jpg" alt="Three friends at a picnic table with fresh fruit and watercolors near Tulum" style="object-position:center 25%;">
      <h3>Family Camp</h3>
      <p class="camp-price"><strong>From $4,000 per person</strong><span>4 days, 5 nights. Longer trips available.</span></p>
      <p>For queer families with kids, teens, and young adults, at a pace that works for every age.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Picnics and easy outdoor days</li>
        <li>Birdwatching and wildlife spotting</li>
        <li>Slow mornings and naps</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#activities" class="camp-type-link">See all possible activities ↓</a>
    </div>
    <div class="camp-type camp-type-team">
      <img class="camp-type-photo" src="/images/hero-jungle-group.jpg" alt="A group of friends smiling together on a jungle trail near Tulum" style="object-position:center 30%;">
      <h3>Team Bonding Camp</h3>
      <p class="camp-price"><strong>From $4,000 per person</strong><span>4 days, 5 nights. Longer trips available.</span></p>
      <p>For businesses and organizations. Time together away from the office, built around your team.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Shared activities and shared meals</li>
        <li>Cultural experiences with a local guide</li>
        <li>An itinerary matched to your goals</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#activities" class="camp-type-link">See all possible activities ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="camp-swipe">← swipe to see all four camps →</p>
  <p class="camp-types-else"><strong>Don't see your camp?</strong> We build trips around anything your group is into. Tell us what you're dreaming up and we'll make it happen.</p>
</section>

<!-- "WHAT THESE TRIPS ACTUALLY ARE" — pulled 2026-09-12, written for multiple group trips, doesn't fit Camp Queerness alone. Full markup preserved in git history, may reuse pieces of this copy elsewhere later. -->

<section class="bleed" id="activities" style="--bleed:var(--white);background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-sm) var(--s-sm) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <p class="sec-eye">Step 2: Mix and match</p>
  <h2>Pick your<br>activities</h2>
  <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin-top:var(--s-sm);">Everything below can be mixed and matched across every camp, depending on what your group is into. Here are a few examples.</p>

  <div class="activity-group activity-group-do">
  <label for="act1" class="act-cover"><img src="/images/IMG_3923.jpeg" alt="Kayaking at sunset near Tulum" style="object-position:center 60%;"></label>
  <input type="checkbox" class="act-toggle" id="act1">
  <label for="act1" class="activity-group-h">Things you'll do</label>
  <div class="activity-boxes">
    <div class="activity-box">Kayak at sunset on the lagoon</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Float through canals built by the ancient Maya</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Explore a private cenote</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Search for birds and monkeys in the jungle</div>
    <input type="checkbox" id="more-do" class="more-toggle">
    <div class="more-wrap">
      <div class="activity-box">Learn new dance moves</div>
      <div class="activity-box">Pre-Hispanic cooking class &amp; mezcal tasting</div>
      <div class="activity-box">Rappel into a cenote</div>
      <div class="activity-box">Cliff jump into a cenote</div>
      <div class="activity-box">Have picnics</div>
      <div class="activity-box">Take naps</div>
      <div class="activity-box activity-box-custom">Custom: anything you want. Tell me and we'll build it in.</div>
    </div>
    <label for="more-do" class="more-btn"></label>
  </div>
  </div>

  <div class="activity-group activity-group-eat">
  <label for="act2" class="act-cover"><img src="/images/food-feature-mango.jpg" alt="A friend holding fresh mangoes at a local fruit market in Tulum" style="object-position:center 35%;"></label>
  <input type="checkbox" class="act-toggle" id="act2">
  <label for="act2" class="activity-group-h">Things you'll eat</label>
  <div class="activity-boxes">
    <div class="activity-box">Mexican and pre-Hispanic food</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Stuff our faces with seasonal fruit</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Meals created by an amazing private chef</div>
    <div class="activity-box activity-box-custom">Custom: anything you want. Tell me and we'll build it in.</div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <div class="activity-group activity-group-learn">
  <label for="act3" class="act-cover"><img src="/images/la-guarida-theater.jpg" alt="A cultural workshop at La Guarida in Tulum" style="object-position:center 50%;"></label>
  <input type="checkbox" class="act-toggle" id="act3">
  <label for="act3" class="activity-group-h">Things you'll learn</label>
  <div class="activity-boxes">
    <div class="activity-box">Get inspired by queer activism in Latin America</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Mexican music, art, and culture</div>
    <div class="activity-box">How Mexicans create community for each other, and the cultural nuances behind it</div>
    <div class="activity-box activity-box-custom">Custom: anything you want. Tell me and we'll build it in.</div>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="comfort">
    <img class="activity-photo comfort-photo" src="/images/la-guarida-workshop-group.jpg" alt="A group workshop at La Guarida, a local cultural center in Tulum" style="object-position:center 40%;">
    <p class="comfort-h">Expand your comfort zone</p>
    <p class="comfort-p">Totally optional. Try something new, with people who get it.</p>
    <div class="stay-chips">
      <span class="stay-chip">Singing classes</span>
      <span class="stay-chip">Pose for a private live drawing session</span>
      <span class="stay-chip">Sensuality and striptease classes</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SAMPLE WEEK -->
<section class="faq" id="sample-week">
  <p class="sec-eye">Step 3: What 4 days can look like</p>
  <h2>A sample camp</h2>
  <p class="week-lead">This is a sample 4 day, 5 night camp, our starting trip. Longer trips add more days, like a jungle day or extra free time. Every group is different and every activity is optional. Adventure, Dance, Family, and Team camps add more of their own focus on top of this.</p>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="wk1">
      <label class="faq-q" for="wk1">Arrival night<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Airport pickup, settle into the villa, and a welcome dinner with stories and introductions.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="wk2">
      <label class="faq-q" for="wk2">Day 1: Cenotes<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Explore a cenote, then a picnic with seasonal fruit.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="wk3">
      <label class="faq-q" for="wk3">Day 2: Water and food<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Float down a river, with time to relax and nap. In the evening, a hands-on cooking class and a shared meal of local food.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="wk4">
      <label class="faq-q" for="wk4">Day 3: Free day and special activities<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Explore Tulum on your own or add a special activity. Rest, play, or try something new.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="wk5">
      <label class="faq-q" for="wk5">Day 4: Art and community<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">A creative day with a local community center: make something with your hands, move together, and give back, then share stories at night.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="wk6">
      <label class="faq-q" for="wk6">Departure morning: Goodbyes<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">A slow morning, last stories together, and airport drop-off.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sample-cta">
    <a href="/bring-your-group" class="btn-groups">Plan your group's camp →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bleed" style="--bleed:var(--bone);background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-sm) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <p class="sec-eye">Home base</p>
  <h2>Where<br>you'll stay</h2>
  <p class="stay-lead">We choose the villa based on your group size.</p>
  <div class="stay-chips">
    <span class="stay-chip">Private villa with a private pool</span>
    <span class="stay-chip">Quiet neighborhood</span>
    <span class="stay-chip">Just outside Tulum town center</span>
    <span class="stay-chip">Easy to explore in free time</span>
    <span class="stay-chip">Hear the jungle at night</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CAMP QUEERNESS — the whole page is this, not boxed as one card among others -->
<section class="bleed" style="--bleed:var(--white);background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-sm) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <div class="trips-about-scroll" id="photo-strip" style="margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);">
    <img src="/images/group-trips-photo.jpg" alt="A group smiling together on a Queerness Experiences trip in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_4652.jpeg" alt="Friends swimming through the mangroves in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_2677.jpeg" alt="Friends at sunset on a dock in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_2244.jpeg" alt="Walking through the mangrove boardwalk in Tulum">
  </div>
  <div class="strip-nav">
    <button type="button" class="strip-arrow" aria-label="Scroll photos left" onclick="document.getElementById('photo-strip').scrollBy({left:-300,behavior:'smooth'})">←</button>
    <button type="button" class="strip-arrow" aria-label="Scroll photos right" onclick="document.getElementById('photo-strip').scrollBy({left:300,behavior:'smooth'})">→</button>
  </div>
  <div class="give-back">
    <p class="sec-eye">We give back</p>
    <p>Every trip donates to a social, cultural, or environmental project in Tulum.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- QUEER CONNECT — paused, focusing on Camp Queerness. Full markup preserved in git history if reviving later. -->

<!-- LUXURY LESBIANS — paused for now, focusing on Camp Queerness. Card removed 2026-09-11, full markup preserved in git history if reviving later. -->

<!-- PARTNER WITH TRIP HOSTS -->
<section class="partner" id="partners">
  <div class="partner-inner">
    <div class="partner-text">
      <p class="sec-eye">For trip hosts and agencies</p>
      <h2>Already host trips?</h2>
      <p>Interested in giving your group an authentic, local experience in Tulum? Plenty of amazing companies already run trips for queer and trans travelers, and we'd love to work with you. We can plan the Tulum part, connect you with local businesses and private chefs, or co-host with you.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/bring-your-group" class="btn-p partner-btn">Let's Work Together →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <p class="sec-eye">Before you book</p>
  <h2>Questions about<br>group trips</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq6">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq6">Is Tulum safe and welcoming for queer and trans people?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Tulum is a genuinely inclusive town where queer and trans people can just exist, not just visit. For the full, honest breakdown, read <a href="/blog/is-tulum-queer-trans-friendly">Is Tulum LGBTQ+ Friendly?</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq3">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq3">How is this different from other queer and sapphic trips?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">These trips are hosted by Santi Solis, founder of Queerness Experiences and a bicultural, bilingual, queer and trans biologist trained at UCLA, who created Camp Queerness and has been running tours for queer and trans travelers in Tulum for years. That means insight into Mexico you can only get from a local.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-min">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-min">How many people do I need for a private trip?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">From 3 to 13 people. If you have a group of three or more friends, we can arrange a camp for you. For one or two people, take a look at the <a href="/tours">tours</a>.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-price">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-price">How much does a camp cost?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Camps start at $4,000 per person for 4 days and 5 nights, flights not included. That covers your private villa with a private pool, most meals, airport pickup and drop-off, local transport, and your activities. Everything is flexible: we can add or remove nights, and the final price depends on your dates, your group size, and the activities you pick. Group rates are available. Tell us about your group and we'll send you a quote.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-incl">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-incl">What's included?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Most meals (some from a private chef, others at local restaurants and small businesses run by friends of ours), airport pickup and drop-off, your place to stay (a private villa with a private pool, picked for your group size), local transport, and all activities. Every activity is optional, and we personalize the trip to your group. Not included: flights and travel insurance. Tell us about dietary restrictions and allergies and we'll plan around them.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq1">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq1">Who can join Camp Queerness?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Camp Queerness is specifically for queer, sapphic, and trans travelers.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-reserve">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-reserve">How do I reserve my spot?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">I like to talk with everyone before they book, so we'll hop on a quick chat first (you can ask me anything then). From there, I'll send you the deposit info to lock in your spot.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="policy-link"><a href="/policies">Policies and disclaimers, including the liability release →</a></p>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-sm) var(--s-sm) var(--s-md);text-align:center;">
  <a href="/waitlist" class="btn-p" style="display:inline-block;">Join the Waitlist →</a>
</section>

<!-- HOST CTA moved to /bring-your-group -->

</Layout>

<style is:global>
@font-face{font-family:'CheddarGothicStencil';src:url('/fonts/CheddarGothicStencil.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{overflow-x:hidden;max-width:100vw;}
:root{
  --magenta:#C8185A;--yellow:#F5A623;--terra:#B5390F;--dark:#1a1a18;
  --white:#FDFCF9;--bone:#F5F0E8;--muted:#4A4034;--border:rgba(26,26,24,0.12);
  --s-sm:16px;--s-md:32px;--s-lg:64px;
  --ff:'Archivo Black','Space Grotesk',sans-serif;--fb:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
}
body{background:var(--bone);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}

/* HEADER */
.head{background:var(--terra);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);position:relative;}
.head-top{position:relative;overflow:hidden;margin:calc(var(--s-md) * -1) calc(var(--s-sm) * -1) 0;padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-md);}
.shape-y{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:40%;height:100%;background:var(--yellow);clip-path:polygon(28% 0,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);z-index:0;}
.head-body{font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:640px;}
.head-eye{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin-bottom:4px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
.head h1{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:40px;line-height:0.96;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--white);position:relative;z-index:2;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);paint-order:stroke fill;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.head p{font-size:19px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);line-height:1.7;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:520px;}
.head-hook{font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:700;font-size:16px !important;color:var(--white) !important;max-width:460px;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);position:relative;z-index:2;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);border-left:3px solid var(--yellow);padding:10px 14px;}
.pull-quote{background:var(--bone);border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);padding:20px 24px;margin:var(--s-md) 0 0;font-family:var(--ff);font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;}
.trips-details-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:var(--s-md);}
.trips-details-list li{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--dark);display:flex;gap:10px;line-height:1.55;}
.trips-details-list li::before{content:'→';color:var(--magenta);flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700;}

/* TRIPS */
.trips{padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);}
.trip{border:3px solid var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-md);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--dark);overflow:hidden;background:var(--white);}
.trip-photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,26,24,0.05),rgba(26,26,24,0.05) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(26,26,24,0.4);text-align:center;padding:12px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);position:relative;}
.trip-photo-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.trip-status{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 10px;border-right:3px solid var(--dark);border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);}
.status-confirmed{background:var(--magenta);color:var(--white);}
.status-soon{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--dark);}
.activity-group-h{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin:0 0 10px;}
.activity-group{padding:var(--s-md);margin-bottom:var(--s-md);}
.villa-text{max-width:640px;}
.activity-group-do{background:rgba(200,24,90,0.06);}
.activity-group-eat{background:rgba(245,166,35,0.10);}
.activity-group-learn{background:rgba(27,77,107,0.07);}
.activity-group .activity-box{background:var(--white);}
.mini-carousel{position:relative;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;max-width:520px;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--magenta);margin:var(--s-md) 0 var(--s-md);}
.mini-carousel input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
.mini-carousel-track{display:flex;width:300%;height:100%;transition:transform 0.4s ease;}
.mini-carousel-track img{width:33.3333%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;}
.mini-carousel-2 .mini-carousel-track{width:200%;}
.mini-carousel-2 .mini-carousel-track img{width:50%;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(0%);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(-33.3333%);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(-66.6666%);}
.mini-carousel-2 input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(-50%);}
.mini-carousel-dots{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:8px;z-index:2;}
.mc-arrow{display:none;position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:34px;height:34px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5);color:var(--white);font-size:18px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;}
.mc-arrow.mc-prev[data-show="1"],.mc-arrow.mc-next[data-show="2"]{display:none !important;}
.mc-arrow.mc-prev{left:10px;}
.mc-arrow.mc-next{right:10px;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .mc-arrow[data-show="1"]{display:flex;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mc-arrow[data-show="2"]{display:flex;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .mc-arrow[data-show="3"]{display:flex;}
.mini-carousel-dots label{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);border:2px solid var(--dark);cursor:pointer;display:block;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .mini-carousel-dots label:nth-child(1){background:var(--magenta);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mini-carousel-dots label:nth-child(2){background:var(--magenta);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .mini-carousel-dots label:nth-child(3){background:var(--magenta);}
.activity-boxes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}
.activity-box{background:var(--bone);border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--magenta);padding:16px;font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--dark);display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:90px;line-height:1.35;min-width:0;}
.activity-box-custom{background:var(--yellow) !important;box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--dark);}
.activity-photo{display:block;width:100%;max-width:520px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--magenta);margin:var(--s-md) 0;}
.activity-group .activity-boxes{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
.activity-box-photo{background-size:cover;background-position:center;position:relative;padding:0;overflow:hidden;}
.activity-box-photo span{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.55);color:var(--white);padding:8px 12px;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;}
@media(min-width:600px){.activity-boxes{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;}}

.trip-body{padding:20px;}
.trip-partner{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin-bottom:6px;}
.trip-name{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:26px;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;}
.trip-desc{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.trip-detail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.detail-pill{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;background:var(--bone);border:2px solid var(--dark);color:var(--dark);}
.trip-foot{border-top:2px solid var(--border);padding-top:14px;}
.btn-trip{display:inline-block;background:var(--magenta);color:var(--white);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:11px 18px;border:2px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--dark);}
.btn-trip-wait{display:inline-block;background:var(--white);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:11px 18px;border:2px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--dark);}

footer{background:var(--blue);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);border-top:3px solid var(--yellow);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-sm);}
.flogo{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--magenta);line-height:1.15;}
.flinks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--s-sm);list-style:none;}
.flinks a{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);}
.trips-about-inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-md);}
.trips-about-scroll{display:flex;gap:12px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;padding-bottom:4px;}
.trips-about-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
.trips-about-scroll img{flex:0 0 240px;width:240px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--dark);scroll-snap-align:start;}

/* CAMP TYPES */
.glance{background:var(--terra);padding:var(--s-sm);}
.glance-grid{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:var(--s-sm) var(--s-md);}
.glance-grid div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;}
.glance-k{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow);}
.glance-v{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--white);line-height:1.3;}
@media(min-width:900px){.glance{padding:var(--s-sm) 40px;}.glance-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);}}
.more-toggle{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
.more-wrap{display:none;}
.more-toggle:checked ~ .more-wrap{display:contents;}
.more-btn{grid-column:1 / -1;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);padding:6px 0;}
.more-btn::before{content:'See more activities +';}
.more-toggle:checked ~ .more-btn::before{content:'See fewer activities \2212';}
#sample-week{padding-bottom:var(--s-sm) !important;}
.comfort-photo{margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);}
.activity-group{display:block !important;}
.act-cover{display:block;cursor:pointer;margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);}
.act-cover img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--accent);}
@media(min-width:720px){.act-cover img{aspect-ratio:21/8;}}
section#reviews{background:var(--white) !important;}
section#reviews h2{color:var(--dark) !important;}
section#reviews .scroll-hint{color:var(--muted) !important;}
.sample-cta{margin-top:var(--s-md);}
.bleed#photo-wrap{padding-top:0 !important;}
.camp-types{background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;}
.camp-types-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin:var(--s-sm) 0 var(--s-md);}
.camp-type-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--s-md);}
.camp-type{background:var(--white);border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--magenta);padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.camp-type-dance{box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);}
.camp-type-family{box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--terra);}
.camp-type-team{box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--blue);}
.camp-type h3{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:24px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:10px;}
.camp-type p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:12px;}
.camp-type ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-bottom:16px;}
.camp-type li{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:8px;line-height:1.45;}
.camp-type li::before{content:'→';color:var(--magenta);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;}
.camp-price{background:var(--yellow);border:3px solid var(--dark);padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:12px !important;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;}
.camp-price strong{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);}
.camp-price span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--dark);}
.camp-type-link{margin-top:auto;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);}
.camp-types .camp-type-grid{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;gap:20px;padding:0 10px 16px 0;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}
.camp-types .camp-type{flex:0 0 82%;scroll-snap-align:start;}
.camp-swipe{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0;}
@media(min-width:600px){.camp-types .camp-type{flex-basis:44%;}}
@media(min-width:960px){.camp-types .camp-type-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);overflow:visible;padding:0 10px 10px 0;}.camp-types .camp-type{flex:none;}.camp-swipe{display:none;}.camp-type-photo{aspect-ratio:4/3 !important;}}
.camp-types-note{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin-top:var(--s-md);}
.camp-types-note a{color:var(--magenta);font-weight:700;}
@media(min-width:720px){
  .camp-types{padding:var(--s-md) 40px;}
  .camp-type-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
}

@media(min-width:720px){
  nav{padding:0 40px;}
  .head{padding:var(--s-lg) 40px;}
  .head h1{font-size:60px;}
  .head-top{margin:calc(var(--s-lg) * -1) -40px 0;padding:var(--s-lg) 40px var(--s-md);}
  .head .hero-grid{width:100%;}
  .trips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:start;padding:var(--s-md) 40px var(--s-lg);max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;}
  .trip{margin-bottom:0;}
  .trips-about-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 440px;gap:48px;align-items:center;}
  footer{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:var(--s-md) 40px;}
  .head p{max-width:900px;}
  .villa-text{max-width:900px;}
}
.bleed{box-shadow:0 0 0 100vmax var(--bleed);clip-path:inset(0 -100vmax);}
@media(min-width:900px){
  .trips-about-scroll img{flex:0 0 280px;width:280px;}
  .scroll-hint{display:none;}
}
.camp-types h2,.bleed h2{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:30px;line-height:1.14;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);}
.camp-types h2{margin-bottom:0;}
@media(min-width:720px){.camp-types h2,.bleed h2{font-size:36px;}}
@media(min-width:900px){
  .camp-types,.bleed{padding-left:min(40px,max(0px,calc(40px - (100vw - 1120px) / 2))) !important;padding-right:min(40px,max(0px,calc(40px - (100vw - 1120px) / 2))) !important;}
}
.policy-link{margin-top:var(--s-md);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;}
.policy-link a{color:var(--magenta);}
.start-now{background:var(--yellow);border-top:3px solid var(--dark);border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);}
.start-now-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-sm);}
.start-now h2{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dark);margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);}
.start-now p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);max-width:560px;}
.start-now .sec-eye{color:var(--dark);}
.start-now-cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;}
.start-now-cta .btn-groups{display:inline-block;background:var(--dark);color:var(--white);border-color:var(--dark);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--magenta);}
.start-now-link{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);text-decoration:underline;}
@media(min-width:720px){
  .start-now{padding:var(--s-lg) 40px;}
  .start-now h2{font-size:44px;}
}
@media(min-width:900px){
  .start-now-inner{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:var(--s-lg);}
  .start-now-cta{align-items:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;}
}
/* ACTIVITY GROUPS: calmer colors, bigger labels, breathing room */
.activity-group{background:var(--bone) !important;border-top:6px solid var(--accent);--accent:var(--magenta);margin-top:var(--s-md);}
.activity-group-eat{--accent:var(--terra);}
.activity-group-learn{--accent:var(--blue);}
.activity-group-h{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:24px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--dark);margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);}
.activity-group .activity-box{box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--accent);}
.activity-group .mini-carousel,.activity-group .activity-photo{box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--accent);}
.activity-group .activity-box-custom{background:transparent !important;border:3px dashed var(--dark);box-shadow:none;font-weight:500;}
.strip-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:var(--s-sm);}
.strip-arrow{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid var(--dark);background:var(--white);color:var(--dark);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--dark);line-height:1;}
.strip-arrow:hover{background:var(--yellow);}
.partner{background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);}
.partner-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-sm);align-items:flex-start;}
.partner h2{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:30px;line-height:1.14;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);}
.partner-text p:last-child{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--dark);max-width:640px;}
.partner-btn{display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;}
@media(min-width:720px){.partner{padding:var(--s-md) 40px;}.partner h2{font-size:36px;}}
@media(min-width:900px){.partner-inner{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:var(--s-lg);}}
.head-left{display:contents;}
@media(min-width:900px){.head-left{display:block;}}
.stay-lead{font-size:19px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);margin-top:var(--s-sm);}
.stay-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:var(--s-sm);}
.stay-chip{background:var(--white);border:2px solid var(--dark);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 18px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);}
.comfort{margin-top:var(--s-md);}
.comfort-h{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:24px;line-height:1.1;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.comfort-p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);}
.week-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin:var(--s-sm) 0 var(--s-md);}
.give-back{margin-top:var(--s-md);}
.give-back p:last-child{font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);max-width:640px;}
.camp-type-photo{display:block;max-width:none;width:calc(100% + 44px);margin:-22px -22px 16px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);}
@media(min-width:720px){.camp-type-photo{aspect-ratio:16/9;}}
.head .hero-grid{width:100%;max-width:none;}
.head-chip{flex:1 1 auto;text-align:center;}
.activity-group{position:relative;}
.act-toggle{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
.activity-group .activity-group-h{cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:0;}
.activity-group .activity-group-h::after{content:'+';font-family:var(--fb);font-size:30px;line-height:1;color:var(--dark);}
.act-toggle:checked ~ .activity-group-h{margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.act-toggle:checked ~ .activity-group-h::after{content:'\2212';}
.act-toggle:not(:checked) ~ :not(.activity-group-h){display:none;}
@media(min-width:900px){.review-scroll .rcard{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;max-width:none;}}
.camp-types-else{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);margin-top:var(--s-md);max-width:640px;}
/* HERO LAYOUT */
.head-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:var(--s-md);position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:640px;}
.head-chip{border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--white);}
.head-credit{font-size:15px !important;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85) !important;margin-top:var(--s-md);max-width:520px !important;}
.head-top{padding-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.head h1{margin-bottom:0;}
.head .hero-grid{margin-top:var(--s-md);max-width:520px;}
